<title>USA: BDM to get new corporate headquarters.</title>
<headline>BDM to get new corporate headquarters.</headline>
<dateline>MCLEAN, Va. 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>BDM International Inc said on Friday it signed a letter of intent to move its corporate headquarters  to Reston, Virginia in January 1999.</p>
<p>The company, currently headquartered in McLean, Virginia, provides information technology, systems and services to public and private sector clients in the U.S. and abroad.</p>
